#!/usr/bin/env golfrun
# stopwatch — sleep for MS milliseconds (default 100), then report the time
# that really passed on the monotonic clock and what the process used:
#   ./stopwatch.golfj 250
#   slept 250 ms (asked 250)
#   user 0 us, system 512 us, maxrss 1080 KB
‹args›"≢[_100⋄0⊇‹num›]→‹ms›
‹now›→‹t0›
←‹ms›‹sleep›
‹now›←‹t0›-1000000/→‹el›
“slept “🗲←‹el›Ṅ“ ms (asked “🗲←‹ms›Ṅ“)“🗲␤
0‹rusage›→‹ru›
“user “🗲←‹ru›0⊇Ṅ“ us, system “🗲←‹ru›1⊇Ṅ“ us, maxrss “🗲←‹ru›2⊇Ṅ“ KB“🗲␤
